<title>NEW ZEALAND: PFI full-year profit NZ$5.29 mln.</title>
<headline>PFI full-year profit NZ$5.29 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31.</p>
<p>			   (million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				  5.29 vs 5.19</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)				 6.2 vs 10.0</p>
<p>    Div (cents)				 3.1 vs 2.6</p>
<p>    Turnover				  10.04 vs 5.53</p>
<p>    Pretax profit			    6.27 vs 5.88</p>
<p>    Tax					  0.98 vs 0.68</p>
<p>    Shares outstanding (million)	118.7 vs 76.43</p>
<p>Dividend carries 0.4799 cps imputation credit.</p>
<p>Pay date May 2</p>
<p>Reg date April 18</p>
<p>    Ex div   April 21</p>
<p>Note - Property for Industry Ltd is a specialist property investor. -- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
